Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:22:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Show recent colors in the color picker

Show the recently picked colors in a row above the palette; clicking one
applies it. Stroke and background pickers each have their own list.

A color is recorded when the picker closes rather than on every change,
so browsing the palette with the arrow keys doesn't flood the list, and
the row stays put while picking. Colors typed into the hex input are
recorded once the input loses focus, so partial values like `#fa5` don't
end up in the list.
